  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Christmas to Remember! feed 980+ families in abuja</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Christmas is a time of love and celebration but due to the high rate of inflation, banditry and insecurity in the country most families can&apos;t afford a decent livelyhood leaving the children to suffer at the hands of child molesters/abusers, child labor, ritual killers, kidnappers and traffickers. Fageli Foundation usually give food items, clothing and more to the less privilege. Our last event recorded over 980 families. We need Your help and support to make this year a Christmas to Remember.</narrative>
  </description>
